SUMMARY:18th Annual Penguin Plunge'n Paddle at Juana's
DESCRIPTION:Juana's hosts the 18th Annual Penguin Plunge'n Paddle on New Y
 ear's Day from 9 AM to 4 PM. Participants dash from the beach into Santa 
 Rosa Sound\, take a stand-up paddle lap\, or cheer from the sand. The day
  supports the Gulf Coast Kiln Walk Society and its ceramic arts education
  work. Raffle tickets run 5 for $20 in advance or 4 for $20 on the day.\n
